{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321321001:1":{"text":"ガ、ガルダさん！こちらがご注文の品です！そうだ、ここに納品書も――","source_cn":"格、格尔达女士，这些是您从瓦迪姆老板那里订的食材。对了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653FB8A39AB64A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321321002:1":{"text":"ワディムのところにはあらゆる食材が揃ってるし、さすがスノーシダー町で一番の商人を謳うだけあるべ。","source_cn":"瓦迪姆手上的食材种类倒是很齐全，真不愧是雪松镇最靠谱的商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96C6AACA4F4E47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321321003:1":{"text":"……ん？数が合わない品があるんだが、ウチの発注ミス？","source_cn":"……嗯？怎么有一些和我订的数量对不上？是我记错了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F966D934EF47D88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321321004:1":{"text":"そ、そのことなんですが……ワディム店長は従業員にあちこちから食材をかき集めさせたのですが、当面調達できたのはそれだけです。あとは新鮮さに欠けていたり、相手が法外な値段をふっかけてきたり……","source_cn":"是……是这样的，瓦迪姆老板派人找遍了公国，但暂时只能采...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD717C0761328F682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321321005:1":{"text":"でも、ご安心ください。不足分も数日の内に必ずお届けします！","source_cn":"不过您放心，瓦迪姆老板过几天一定会补上这些缺口！这是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14AE355874740CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321321006:1":{"text":"しばらくは仕方ないべ……アンタたちのせいじゃないよ。","source_cn":"唉……这也不能怪你们，暂时这样吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16A42AD327986830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321321007:1":{"text":"ところでガルダさん、お魚さんたちはどうです？環境に適応できそうですか？","source_cn":"对了，格尔达女士，你的鱼怎么样了？有没有能适应温泉环境的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA432AE14778380D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321321008:1":{"text":"そのことなんだが、良いニュースと悪いニュースがあるべ。","source_cn":"亲爱的，在这方面有两个好消息，也有一个坏消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E75EDFB11650E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321321009:1":{"text":"良いニュースは、温泉環境に適応できる魚が二種類いたこと。それがアイスキャットフィッシュとアロマコハダ。悪いニュースは……最もポピュラーな食材であるババシュリンプが適応できなかったことだべ。","source_cn":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4A0ACE76BC07AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1321321009":{"text":"良いニュースは、温泉環境に適応できる魚が二種類いたこと。それがアイスキャットフィッシュとアロマコハダ。悪いニュースは……最もポピュラーな食材であるババシュリンプが適応できなかったことだべ。","source_cn":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是——这两种鱼刚好是冰猫鱼和香脂鲱，作为食材最受欢迎的巴巴虾却没办法适应温泉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4A0ACE76BC07AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321321010:2":{"text":"確か、ホワイトマウンテン公国の特産品の一つです。すごく美味しくて、生でも食べられるんですよね！","source_cn":"我记得，巴巴虾是白山公国最出名的美食之一，味道鲜美，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF7ACA8D7394F30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321321011:1":{"text":"――えっ！？っということは、ロンロンは食べられないのですか！","source_cn":"——什么？！那满满这次岂不是吃不到了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED896626389756F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321321012:1":{"text":"安心しな。話はまだ終わってないんだ。","source_cn":"别担心，亲爱的。还有另一个好消息呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2FCD9241C07E274","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321321013:1":{"text":"実は、良いニュースがもう一つあるべ。なんとアロマコハダの分泌器官が温泉に刺激され、より濃厚な香りを放つようになったんだよ。","source_cn":"我发现，温泉水可以激发香脂鲱的腺体，让它散发出更浓郁的香气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC955470A0FFE06EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321321014:1":{"text":"そこでウチは、このアロマコハダで新メニューを作れないかと考えた。うまくいけば、旅館の新たな名物になるかもしれない！","source_cn":"所以，我想试着用香脂鲱研发一道新菜，看看味道和卖相如何...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64"